	(text "WARNING\n\nDo NOT have a single ground plane or \"stacked\" ground planes\n\nALL 24V connections MUST be on their own ground plane COMPLETELY\nand fully isolated from the 3.3V side. Do NOT route any\ntraces over the other.\n\nSee datasheet for more info"
